# `design` and `docs` are for humans and reach neither image.
design
docs

# `apps` is NOT excluded, and that is deliberate. Dockerfile.web builds the
# three front-ends and needs them in the context; .dockerignore governs the
# context, which both Dockerfiles share. Keeping them out of the API image is
# the API Dockerfile's job and it already does it — it copies `backend` and
# `packages/money` by name and nothing else — so listing `apps` here bought a
# slightly smaller upload and would have silently made `COPY apps` copy
# nothing.
